# Avatar Model Placeholder

This file indicates where the 3D avatar model should be placed.

## Required File
`avatar-default.glb` - Your 3D avatar model in GLB format

## How to Add

See [AVATAR_SETUP.md](../AVATAR_SETUP.md) for detailed instructions.

Quick options:
1. Create avatar at https://readyplayer.me/
2. Download free models from https://sketchfab.com/
3. Use sample models from https://www.mixamo.com/

Once you have a GLB file, place it here as `avatar-default.glb`

## File Structure
```
public/
├── avatar-default.glb  <-- Place your model here
└── .gitkeep            <-- This file
```
